## What If…?

What if the chatroom forms before the media is added, based on predicted interests?
What if media auto‑summaries or AI characters join the chatroom?

## Rapid Ideation
A chatroom that only opens when two people add the same media at the same time
A chatroom that locks until someone answers a trivia question
A chatroom that changes color/theme based on genre
A chatroom that auto‑moderates using the media’s themes
A chatroom that lets media creators join if verified
A chatroom that recommends new media based on conversation sentiment
XP for insights, badges for references
A chatroom that creates a shared playlist
A chatroom that lets users vote to kick and on the next media to watch
A chatroom that connects strangers who watched the same thing at the same time

