## Forced Juxtaposition

This project was everything ive ever watched and i mixed it with one of those apps you can chat with people

## Kill Your Idea

Nobody joins the chatroom.
-> You need incentives and/or discovery features.
-> Have one main chatroom for looking for something to watch.
-> A chatroom to recommend

People add media incorrectly or spam.
-> You need verification or moderation.

Chatrooms become chaotic or toxic.
→ You need structure, report system, roles, or AI moderation.

## What If NOT…?

WHat if you don't want to see spoilers
-> Chats are recommended once you are caught up. You can join whenever but at your own risk. I thought about chatrooms for individual episodes and no spoilers but that'll be to much managing and excessive.

